e for different `source` tags is not resolved when using `~` or `@`.\r\n\r\n### Reproduction 🐞\r\n\r\n```html\r\n<picture>\r\n    <source\r\n      srcset=\"\r\n        @/assets/images/some_image_2x.png 2x,\r\n        @/assets/images/some_image.png\r\n      \"\r\n      type=\"image/png\"\r\n    />\r\n    <source\r\n      srcset=\"\r\n        @/assets/images/some_image_2x.webp 2x,\r\n        @/assets/images/some_image.webp\r\n      \"\r\n      type=\"image/webp\"\r\n    />\r\n    <img\r\n      loading=\"lazy\"\r\n      src=\"@/assets/images/some_image.png\"\r\n    />\r\n  </picture>\r\n```\r\n\r\nThis will result in this code, at least in dev mode (haven't checked the `build` but my guess is that it's incorrect there as well):\r\n\r\n```html\r\n<picture>\r\n    <source\r\n      srcset=\"\r\n        /src/components/@/assets/images/some_image.png 2x,\r\n        /src/components/@/assets/images/some_image.png\"\r\n      type=\"image/png\"\r\n    >\r\n    <source\r\n      srcset=\"\r\n        /src/components/@/assets/images/some_image_2x.webp 2x,\r\n        /src/components/@/assets/images/some_image.webp\"\r\n      type=\"image/webp\"\r\n    >\r\n    <img\r\n      loading=\"lazy\"\r\n      src=\"/src/assets/images/some_image.png\"\r\n    >\r\n  </picture>\r\n```\r\n\r\n<details>\r\n<summary>Dependencies Info</summary>\r\n\r\n```\r\niles v0.6.4 vite v2.6.14\r\n```\r\n</details>\r\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ElMassimo/iles/issues/35/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ElMassimo/iles/issues/35/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}},"event":"cross-referenced"},{"id":6588230077,"node_id":"CE_lADOCCum1849cXAuzwAAAAGIsGm9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vuejs/core/issues/events/6588230077","actor":{"login":"yyx990803","id":499550,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ5OTU1MA==","avatar_url":"https://a